---
// HowToHelp.astro - Sección Cómo Ayudar / Formas de Apoyo
---

<section
  id="como-ayudar"
  class="w-full py-12 md:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto rounded-3xl reveal-on-scroll"
  style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) 0%, transparent 60%), url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width=\'40\' height=\'40\' viewBox=\'0 0 40 40\' xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%3E%3Ccircle cx=\'20\' cy=\'20\' r=\'1\' fill=\'%23C8BBAA\' fill-opacity=\'0.16\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E');"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-soft-chip text-primary-dark font-bold text-xs mb-3 border border-neutral-border/30">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]">handshake</span>
      <span>Acciones solidarias</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-primary-dark tracking-tight">
      Hay muchas formas de dar una pata
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base text-text-main/80 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
      Cada muestra de apoyo suma para brindar una segunda oportunidad a perritos rescatados.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
    <!-- 1. Donación Monetaria -->
    <div class="bg-card-bg rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-neutral-border/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between h-full reveal-on-scroll stagger-1">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-soft-chip flex items-center justify-center text-primary-cta mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">favorite</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-dark mb-3">Donación monetaria</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-main/75 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Tu aporte económico voluntario contribuye al cuidado, alimentación y atenciones médicas que requieren los perritos rescatados.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-neutral-border/20">
        <a href="#donaciones" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-cta font-bold text-sm hover:text-primary-dark transition-colors group">
          <span>Ver cuentas de donación</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Donación en Especie -->
    <div class="bg-card-bg rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-neutral-border/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between h-full reveal-on-scroll stagger-2">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-soft-chip flex items-center justify-center text-primary-cta mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">inventory_2</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-dark mb-3">Donación en especie</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-main/75 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Puedes colaborar con alimento para cachorros y adultos, artículos de higiene, cobijas y suministros para su bienestar cotidiano.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-neutral-border/20">
        <a href="#donaciones-especie" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-cta font-bold text-sm hover:text-primary-dark transition-colors group">
          <span>Ver lista de insumos</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Centros de Acopio -->
    <div class="bg-card-bg rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-neutral-border/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between h-full reveal-on-scroll stagger-3">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-soft-chip flex items-center justify-center text-primary-cta mb-6 shadow-sm">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">storefront</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary-dark mb-3">Centros de acopio</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-main/75 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Entrega tus donaciones físicas en los establecimientos aliados en San Salvador, Santa Tecla y Antiguo Cuscatlán.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-auto pt-5 border-t border-neutral-border/20">
        <a href="#centros-acopio" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary-cta font-bold text-sm hover:text-primary-dark transition-colors group">
          <span>Ubicar centros de acopio</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
